/ Input: none
/ Test 16 (bonus): sum an array of 5 numbers with AddI and a pointer
        Clear
        Store Sum
Loop,   Load Count
        Skipcond 800       / Count > 0: add the next element
        Jump Done
        Load Sum
        AddI Ptr           / AC = Sum + M[M[Ptr]] (the element Ptr points at)
        Store Sum
        Load Ptr           / move the pointer to the next element
        Add One
        Store Ptr
        Load Count
        Subt One
        Store Count
        Jump Loop
Done,   Load Sum
        Output             / 10 + 20 - 5 + 7 + 3 = 35
        Halt
Sum,    Dec 0
Count,  Dec 5
One,    Dec 1
Ptr,    Hex 016            / the address of Arr (016)
Arr,    Dec 10
        Dec 20
        Dec -5
        Dec 7
        Dec 3
